    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u300aStory\u300b</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093850/extras/7a06d2b4035c1bf390d435373ff44e61.poster.avif?t=1753434528\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093850/extras/7a06d2b4035c1bf390d435373ff44e61.webm?t=1753434528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093850/extras/7a06d2b4035c1bf390d435373ff44e61.mp4?t=1753434528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Risa has been friends with her neighbors, the Takeuchi brothers, for a long time.<br>Naturally, they were both into her.<br><br>Eventually, Risa married Seiichi, the older one of the two brothers.<br>The younger brother, Ryuji, acted like he was happy for his brother, but a massive inferiority complex was simmering inside him.<br><br>One day, Ryuji hears from Risa that, due to Seiichi being infertile, they are unable to have children.<br>Until then, Seiichi, the golden child, had never experienced any setbacks in life.<br>If his first taste of failure came at this age, there's a chance he'd never be able to recover from it.<br><br>Then, Ryuji makes a suggestion to Risa.<br><br><i>&quot;I'll get you pregnant in place of my brother.&quot;</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u300aCharacters\u300b</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093850/extras/5c63945e122c04e5c0dff51251578bc6.poster.avif?t=1753434528\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093850/extras/5c63945e122c04e5c0dff51251578bc6.webm?t=1753434528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093850/extras/5c63945e122c04e5c0dff51251578bc6.mp4?t=1753434528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Risa Takeuchi (VA: Hina Shinomiya)</strong><br>A childhood friend of the Takeuchi brothers.<br>She's in a loving marriage with Seiichi, but she still acts like an adoring older sister to Ryuji just like when they were kids.<br>She's a caring and considerate person who gives her all for others.<br>She's a little awkward around men, and she's only familiar with vanilla sex.<br>She's worried about not being able to have children.<br><br><strong>Seiichi Takeuchi</strong><br>Ryuji's older brother.<br>No matter what he does, he does it perfectly.<br>He's also a genuinely nice guy who's protective of his younger brother Ryuji without looking down on him.<br><br><strong>Ryuji Takeuchi</strong><br>The protagonist.<br>He's had a crush on Risa for a long time.<br>His feelings toward her haven't changed even after she married his brother.<br>He has a lot of unresolved feelings surrounding his perfect older brother.<br><br>*Before purchasing this product, we highly recommend that you play the demo [Japanese only] to check if the game works properly on your computer in your region.<br>*Appetite is the licensor of this game. For inquiries about the product, please contact Tensei Games.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u300aContents\u300b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 separate CGs (Over 60 CGs in total!)</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 H-scenes</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Japanese voice acting for the main female character</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u300aFeatures\u300b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You can have the same experience as the protagonist.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two endings</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>CG Gallery Mode</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Scene Replay Mode</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u300aStory\u300b</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093850/extras/7a06d2b4035c1bf390d435373ff44e61.poster.avif?t=1753434528\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093850/extras/7a06d2b4035c1bf390d435373ff44e61.webm?t=1753434528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093850/extras/7a06d2b4035c1bf390d435373ff44e61.mp4?t=1753434528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Risa has been friends with her neighbors, the Takeuchi brothers, for a long time.<br>Naturally, they were both into her.<br><br>Eventually, Risa married Seiichi, the older one of the two brothers.<br>The younger brother, Ryuji, acted like he was happy for his brother, but a massive inferiority complex was simmering inside him.<br><br>One day, Ryuji hears from Risa that, due to Seiichi being infertile, they are unable to have children.<br>Until then, Seiichi, the golden child, had never experienced any setbacks in life.<br>If his first taste of failure came at this age, there's a chance he'd never be able to recover from it.<br><br>Then, Ryuji makes a suggestion to Risa.<br><br><i>&quot;I'll get you pregnant in place of my brother.&quot;</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u300aCharacters\u300b</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093850/extras/5c63945e122c04e5c0dff51251578bc6.poster.avif?t=1753434528\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093850/extras/5c63945e122c04e5c0dff51251578bc6.webm?t=1753434528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093850/extras/5c63945e122c04e5c0dff51251578bc6.mp4?t=1753434528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Risa Takeuchi (VA: Hina Shinomiya)</strong><br>A childhood friend of the Takeuchi brothers.<br>She's in a loving marriage with Seiichi, but she still acts like an adoring older sister to Ryuji just like when they were kids.<br>She's a caring and considerate person who gives her all for others.<br>She's a little awkward around men, and she's only familiar with vanilla sex.<br>She's worried about not being able to have children.<br><br><strong>Seiichi Takeuchi</strong><br>Ryuji's older brother.<br>No matter what he does, he does it perfectly.<br>He's also a genuinely nice guy who's protective of his younger brother Ryuji without looking down on him.<br><br><strong>Ryuji Takeuchi</strong><br>The protagonist.<br>He's had a crush on Risa for a long time.<br>His feelings toward her haven't changed even after she married his brother.<br>He has a lot of unresolved feelings surrounding his perfect older brother.<br><br>*Before purchasing this product, we highly recommend that you play the demo [Japanese only] to check if the game works properly on your computer in your region.<br>*Appetite is the licensor of this game. For inquiries about the product, please contact Tensei Games.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u300aContents\u300b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 separate CGs (Over 60 CGs in total!)</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 H-scenes</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Japanese voice acting for the main female character</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u300aFeatures\u300b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You can have the same experience as the protagonist.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two endings</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>CG Gallery Mode</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Scene Replay Mode</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Golden boy Seiichi has never failed in anything before -- until now, at least. After experiencing failure for the first time at this age, he might not be able to recover. That's when Ryuji makes a suggestion to Risa: &quot;I'll get you pregnant in place of my brother.&quot;",
